From b419730d992779726d2c4f4d775f50f88a8f1475 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Grahmann <lars.grahmann@googlemail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:34:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] synaptics_tudor: Add enroll, verify, identify and delete

Done from a trace of the vendor driver with a finger on the sensor.
Captures go through the event endpoint, enroll takes the sensor's own
number of captures and commits the template with a user id string as
payload. Verify and identify compare the template id the sensor reports
with the one stored in the print. Delete removes the user of a template
after checking it has no other template.
